<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SMART, MCRETAIL UNIT IN TALKS ON MERGER.</title>
<headline>SMART, MCRETAIL UNIT IN TALKS ON MERGER.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smart Group Holdings Ltd and McCarthy Retail Ltd said on Tuesday they were in talks about the potential merger between Smart and McCarthy clothing and footwear division Clobea.</p>
<p>They said the successful conclusion of these talks could have an impact on both McCarthy Retail and Smart's security prices on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Share and convertible debenture holders in the companies were advised to exercise caution in their security dealings until further notice.</p>
<p>No further details were given in a brief announcement.</p>
